# Dev workflow

- Local run: `uvicorn app:app --reload` (port 8000 by default; `.claude/launch.json` has this
  wired for the in-editor preview browser).
- Python deps: `requirements.txt` — no upper-version pins, all floor-only (`>=`).
- `eval_regression_suite.py` + `golden_dataset.json` — a regression test harness checking system
  prompt encoding, retrieved-context injection, and brand-safety/compliance heuristics across the
  agents. Run this after touching any agent's prompt logic.
- `scripts/archive/` — old one-off dev/patch scripts (`fix_*.py`, `append_*.py`,
  `scratch_update_*.py`) moved here via `git mv`; they were how earlier ad-hoc patches got applied
  to `static/app.js`/`index.html` before larger changes started going through normal edits. Dead
  weight, kept only for history — don't build on top of them.
- `demo_rag_ad_agent.py` / `clean_transcript.py` — standalone utility scripts, not imported by
  `app.py`, used for one-off RAG pipeline demos and `.docx` transcript cleanup respectively.
